# Local market data downloads and scratch dirs.
# NOTE: these MUST be root-anchored. A bare `data/` matches ANY directory named
# `data` at any depth, which silently ignored src/nsealgo/data/ -- the entire
# data-cleaning layer was missing from the repo while existing in the working
# tree, so CI failed with "No module named 'nsealgo.data'".
/data/
/tmp/
/logs/
/state-nse/
